# Floodpits Drowner: the target may be a creature its own controller controls. Baloth Prime enters tapped with six stun
# counters (CR 122.1g), so Bot1's Drowner (cast on turn 1) can shuffle itself and Baloth Prime into their owners'
# libraries, both Bot1's: both leave the battlefield at once and Bot1's library grows by two (one shuffle of one library,
# CR 701.24a). Bot2's creature-less side shows nothing else moves.

